{"id": "86074", "name": "אינטגרל לא מסוים של cos⁴(kt) – הורדת חזקה פעמיים (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Find</p><p>Hint: square an identity for \\(\\cos^2(A)\\).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle \\int {{CT:0}}\\,d{{CT:1}} = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Lower the power with \\(\\cos^2(A)=\\frac{1}{2}[1+\\cos(2A)]\\) twice, until only first powers of cosines are left, then integrate term by term.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Square the identity</b><br><p>For this question we need to use the identity</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\cos^2(A) = \\frac{1}{2}[1+\\cos(2A)] \\]</p><p>as follows:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{aligned} {{CT:0}} &= [{{CT:2}}]^2\\\\ &= \\left[{{CT:3}}\\right]^2 \\\\ &= {{CT:4}} \\end{aligned} \\]</p><p>So,</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int {{CT:0}} d{{CT:1}} = \\int {{CT:4}} d{{CT:1}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Use the identity again</b><br><p>To solve this integral we need to express</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:5}} \\]</p><p>in a simpler form using the same identity:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{aligned} {{CT:5}} &= {{CT:6}}{{CT:7}} \\\\ &= {{CT:6}}\\left[{{CT:8}}\\right] \\\\ &= {{CT:9}} \\end{aligned} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — Integrate</b><br><p>Hence,</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{aligned} \\int {{CT:0}} d{{CT:1}} &= \\int \\left({{CT:9}} + {{CT:10}} + {{CT:6}}\\right) d{{CT:1}} \\\\ &= \\int {{CT:11}} d{{CT:1}} \\\\ &= {{CT:12}} \\end{aligned} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Int", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "expand(int(p,v))+c", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["k", "p", "pp", "q", "q1", "q2", "q3", "q4", "rdm1", "v"], "nvariants": 3}